WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.934
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:14.955 --> 00:16.680
- Sign it. - No, I won't.

10
00:16.726 --> 00:18.600
- I warned you about the steel. - Let go of my son.

11
00:19.595 --> 00:21.760
You damn masseur. I’m coming for you.

12
00:25.683 --> 00:26.684
Mom!

13
00:28.883 --> 00:29.884
Flatfoot!

14
00:32.944 --> 00:33.745
Mom!

15
00:33.824 --> 00:35.840
I need both of you to come to the police station

16
00:35.850 --> 00:37.200
for questioning in connection with a murder case.

17
00:37.232 --> 00:39.360
Police Colonel Krit.

18
00:39.595 --> 00:42.880
He killed my mother! He killed my brother!

19
00:44.387 --> 00:46.800
The Black Book says

20
00:46.904 --> 00:48.960
massage can be used to kill.

21
00:49.102 --> 00:51.000
Today marks the auspicious official launch

22
00:51.094 --> 00:52.961
of the อโรคยาแลนด์project.

23
00:53.095 --> 00:55.440
Dongyang, a Chinese businessman,

24
00:55.496 --> 00:58.520
has invested an enormous sum in this project.

25
00:58.582 --> 01:00.800
Moreover, we are joined by Master Tim,

26
01:00.883 --> 01:02.880
who is regarded as a grand master of traditional Thai massage.

27
01:03.000 --> 01:07.120
My sole intention is to support our massage therapists

28
01:07.140 --> 01:08.820
to join อโรคยาแลนด์.

29
01:08.840 --> 01:12.360
Anyone wants to become a massage therapist,you’re welcome to apply.

30
01:12.405 --> 01:13.600
There’s no way it’s just a wellness center.

31
01:13.638 --> 01:15.480
Maybe he’ll only stop committing evil once he’s dead.

32
03:28.750 --> 03:29.751
Shit!

33
03:52.176 --> 03:53.177
Hey!

34
03:54.712 --> 03:56.291
Panic? Are you having a panic attack?

35
03:57.939 --> 03:59.680
Calm down. Calm down.

36
04:01.315 --> 04:02.960
It’s okay. Just stay calm.

37
04:03.032 --> 04:04.958
Look at me. Look at me.

38
04:06.334 --> 04:07.335
Breathe in.

39
04:07.752 --> 04:08.753
Breathe out.

40
04:08.979 --> 04:09.980
Take deep breaths.

41
04:10.360 --> 04:11.361
In.

42
04:11.678 --> 04:12.679
Out.

43
04:13.385 --> 04:14.386
In.

44
04:14.883 --> 04:15.884
Out.

45
04:19.603 --> 04:20.604
Just stay calm, okay?

46
04:30.819 --> 04:31.820
Are you okay?

47
06:01.568 --> 06:02.569
How was it?

48
06:05.814 --> 06:07.440
There was an accident, so I missed him.

49
06:08.499 --> 06:09.800
I’ll take care of it tonight.

50
06:12.590 --> 06:14.091
He’s already flown to Shanghai.

51
06:21.120 --> 06:22.280
I’m sorry, Dad.

52
06:48.184 --> 06:51.294
Arokaya Land is holding massage therapist tryouts tomorrow.

53
06:51.422 --> 06:52.423
Interested?

54
06:52.523 --> 06:54.324
[Now hiring a large number of Thai massage therapists]

55
07:03.118 --> 07:04.125
I’m coming for you,

56
07:04.390 --> 07:05.391
Dongyang.

57
07:27.850 --> 07:29.551
[Now hiring a large number of Thai massage therapists]

58
08:24.182 --> 08:25.183
What did your boss say?

59
08:25.960 --> 08:27.061
She didn't know about it.

60
08:27.560 --> 08:30.161
She can't find out about it. I am taking a day off today.

61
08:31.440 --> 08:32.441
Thanks

62
08:32.600 --> 08:35.080
for pushing me to take that Thai traditional medicine assistant course.

63
08:35.750 --> 08:38.440
Otherwise, I wouldn’t even be eligible to apply to work with Master Tim.

64
08:39.963 --> 08:43.120
My insider says the pay is really good.

65
08:43.246 --> 08:44.960
Even without guaranteed pay, I’d still take the job.

66
09:19.848 --> 09:20.849
Sit down.

67
09:32.486 --> 09:34.087
Master Tim will personally test your massage skills.

68
09:34.427 --> 09:35.428
Once everyone has completed the test,

69
09:35.760 --> 09:37.200
the results will be announced together.

70
09:38.200 --> 09:41.701
With this many applicants, who knows when the testing will finish?

71
09:44.536 --> 09:46.600
Wrist pulse point.

72
09:47.520 --> 09:48.600
Palm point.

73
09:49.040 --> 09:50.456
Everyone heard that, right?

74
09:50.915 --> 09:52.200
First row, please come forward.

75
09:52.680 --> 09:54.250
Next row, follow closely and keep the line moving.

76
10:03.832 --> 10:04.833
Go.

77
10:21.616 --> 10:22.617
Enough.

78
10:54.320 --> 10:55.721
This might hurt a little, Master.

79
10:59.462 --> 11:00.560
May I?

80
11:29.912 --> 11:31.420
Are your hands too stiff to greet your elders?

81
11:39.296 --> 11:40.297
May I?

82
11:59.160 --> 12:02.560
How calm must his mind be for his pulse to be this faint?

83
12:30.440 --> 12:31.850
You’re not allowed to touch above the wrist.

84
12:32.547 --> 12:33.548
It’s okay.

85
12:35.982 --> 12:37.300
Are you the new generation of Thai massage therapists?

86
13:05.230 --> 13:06.360
Don’t you want a Chaleo?

87
13:22.715 --> 13:23.716
Do we have more?

88
13:24.334 --> 13:25.440
She was the last one.

89
13:27.904 --> 13:29.905
Hello!

90
13:31.163 --> 13:33.320
Hello, everyone!

91
13:38.788 --> 13:41.840
I’m the majority shareholder here.

92
13:42.640 --> 13:45.240
I invested in this place with Master Tim

93
13:46.720 --> 13:48.321
because I love massages.

94
13:49.571 --> 13:52.720
But I only get massages from therapists at Arokaya.

95
13:54.440 --> 13:58.600
Therapists personally handpicked by Master Tim.

96
14:00.340 --> 14:02.641
Anyone who gives me a massage I like

97
14:03.304 --> 14:04.520
will be rich.

98
14:04.987 --> 14:05.988
Rich.

99
14:06.139 --> 14:07.140
Rich!

100
14:09.238 --> 14:10.640
- Do you want to be rich? - Yes, sir.

101
14:11.239 --> 14:12.240
Do you want it?

102
14:12.699 --> 14:14.050
Do you want to be rich? Give me your hand.

103
14:14.088 --> 14:15.089
Do you want to be rich?

104
14:15.390 --> 14:16.520
Do you?

105
14:16.675 --> 14:17.676
Give me your hand. Rich!

106
14:17.776 --> 14:20.480
Rich, rich, rich!

107
14:21.240 --> 14:22.280
Rich!

108
14:43.760 --> 14:45.361
Rich, rich, rich!

109
14:45.600 --> 14:47.440
RICH!

110
14:51.358 --> 14:53.000
Those who received a Chaleo have passed.

111
14:53.918 --> 14:55.580
Our staff will escort you to Human Resources.

112
14:56.054 --> 14:57.760
Everyone else may leave. Thank you.

113
15:02.187 --> 15:03.820
Why didn’t they just tell us we failed?

114
15:04.278 --> 15:05.939
They made us wait and waste our time.

115
15:07.011 --> 15:08.760
The signal point is only as wide as a matchstick,

116
15:10.126 --> 15:11.760
yet you have the nerve to apply as a therapist here.

117
15:18.440 --> 15:20.200
Anyone who received a Chaleo with a broken spoke

118
15:23.678 --> 15:24.679
has failed the test.

119
15:33.067 --> 15:34.068
How come?

120
15:48.550 --> 15:49.936
Master Tim! Master Tim!

121
15:53.878 --> 15:54.879
What is it?

122
15:56.784 --> 15:58.560
I’d like to know the judging criteria.

123
16:00.123 --> 16:01.124
Muk.

124
16:02.784 --> 16:03.785
Give us a minute.

125
16:15.885 --> 16:17.886
You’re not suited to work as a therapist here.

126
16:18.248 --> 16:20.136
But you said you wanted to work with a new generation of therapists.

127
16:20.149 --> 16:21.150
That’s right.

128
16:21.845 --> 16:23.520
Then aren’t you choosing us based on our skills?

129
16:27.107 --> 16:28.170
The younger generation…

130
16:30.990 --> 16:32.091
So confident.

131
16:37.520 --> 16:38.600
Your shoulders are tense.

132
16:40.963 --> 16:42.680
Stiff and stressed.

133
16:43.047 --> 16:44.320
It’s like you’re carrying a heavy burden.

134
16:46.206 --> 16:47.207
Trust me.

135
16:47.552 --> 16:48.760
You’re not suited to this place.

136
16:50.262 --> 16:51.763
But I really want to work here.

137
16:52.598 --> 16:53.850
Could you test my massage skills again?

138
16:54.838 --> 16:56.250
Just tell me exactly how you want it.

139
16:56.270 --> 16:57.360
Firmer or gentler—I can adjust it for you.

140
17:06.104 --> 17:07.105
All right.

141
17:14.240 --> 17:16.241
[WARNING: The massage techniques depicted in this series are entirely fictional.]

142
17:16.250 --> 17:18.251
[Do not attempt to imitate them.]

143
18:15.238 --> 18:16.239
Impatient.

144
18:17.558 --> 18:18.600
Your cup is already full.

145
18:20.427 --> 18:21.528
Do you know the answer now?

146
18:55.251 --> 18:56.760
I heard you

147
18:57.683 --> 19:00.000
tell that girl

148
19:00.171 --> 19:01.450
that her cup was already full.

149
19:04.278 --> 19:05.600
What does that mean?

150
19:07.435 --> 19:09.100
She’s too eager to show off what she’s learned.

151
19:22.080 --> 19:23.081
Go straight to the room.

152
19:24.616 --> 19:25.617
Yes, Master.

153
19:25.870 --> 19:27.250
You sure took your time answering.

154
21:15.182 --> 21:16.560
Hey, kiddo.

155
21:17.183 --> 21:19.100
I told you to stay put. You’ll only get hurt again.

156
21:19.800 --> 21:20.801
Are you okay?

157
21:34.878 --> 21:37.920
Good thing you could still speak and ask someone to call me to pick you up.

158
21:39.838 --> 21:41.439
It’s only your first day, and they’ve already hurt you this badly.

159
21:42.810 --> 21:44.711
I don’t think you should get involved with them anymore.

160
21:48.179 --> 21:49.680
The plai smells so nice, Wan.

161
21:52.024 --> 21:53.180
Don’t change the subject.

162
21:53.560 --> 21:56.254
Both Dongyang and Master Tim are dangerous. Don’t risk it.

163
21:58.680 --> 22:01.134
If I want to get close to them, I have to do it through massage.

164
22:13.347 --> 22:14.348
Does it hurt a lot?

165
22:15.262 --> 22:17.000
Your breath smells like that of someone who’s sick.

166
22:21.624 --> 22:22.625
Something’s blocked.

167
22:23.822 --> 22:24.823
I can’t fix it.

168
22:26.110 --> 22:27.111
I feel...

169
22:28.111 --> 22:29.400
a sudden wave of heat.

170
22:31.139 --> 22:32.820
I’ve never met anyone capable of doing something like this.

171
22:34.174 --> 22:35.175
Master Tim.

172
22:35.763 --> 22:36.960
Now I believe he really is that good.

173
22:39.700 --> 22:40.701
Ask Uncle Korn.

174
22:41.726 --> 22:42.767
Then he will find out about it.

175
22:43.247 --> 22:45.450
Oh, don’t act like you’ve never lied before.

176
22:55.166 --> 22:56.280
That’s enough, Dad.

177
22:59.411 --> 23:00.412
Who did this to you?

178
23:00.787 --> 23:02.560
It was just a minor accident, Dad.

179
23:02.640 --> 23:03.641
You’re lying.

180
23:04.080 --> 23:05.681
Those are the effects of pressure applied below the collarbone.

181
23:06.608 --> 23:08.140
This wasn’t an accident.

182
23:13.360 --> 23:14.361
Hello, Uncle.

183
23:15.131 --> 23:17.300
Did you receive the medicine I sent you?

184
23:18.256 --> 23:19.520
What happened to her, Wan?

185
23:20.304 --> 23:21.745
Uh, she fell off her motorcycle.

186
23:22.528 --> 23:24.560
I have another call coming in. I have to go.

187
23:24.683 --> 23:25.684
Goodbye.

188
23:28.998 --> 23:30.040
Stop it.

189
23:30.107 --> 23:32.315
If your dad finds out, we will both be in trouble.

190
23:39.384 --> 23:41.300
By the time Dad finds out, I’ll probably have succeeded already.

191
23:42.250 --> 23:43.360
Succeeded at what?

192
23:45.248 --> 23:46.249
Hey, kiddo.

193
23:46.982 --> 23:48.000
What are you trying to accomplish?

194
24:21.200 --> 24:22.760
Calm down. Calm down.

195
24:22.907 --> 24:24.808
Look at me. Look at me.

196
24:26.190 --> 24:27.191
Breathe in.

197
24:27.736 --> 24:28.737
Breathe out.

198
24:28.808 --> 24:29.809
Take deep breaths.

199
24:30.160 --> 24:31.161
In.

200
24:31.571 --> 24:32.572
Out.

201
24:33.176 --> 24:34.177
In.

202
24:34.760 --> 24:35.761
Out.

203
25:14.792 --> 25:16.200
Come here, come on.

204
25:17.358 --> 25:18.359
Hurry.

205
25:19.182 --> 25:20.360
Hello.

206
25:20.648 --> 25:22.080
You need to sit first. Sit.

207
25:22.462 --> 25:24.240
Are you hungry? Are you hungry?

208
25:25.112 --> 25:26.440
Come on, sit.

209
25:27.011 --> 25:29.240
You must be hungry. Here.

210
25:29.795 --> 25:30.796
Is it good?

211
25:32.040 --> 25:33.041
You want more?

212
26:06.651 --> 26:07.652
Hello.

213
26:13.774 --> 26:15.000
One of the medicines is out of stock.

214
26:15.075 --> 26:17.100
I’ve already ordered it, but it hasn’t been delivered yet.

215
26:17.518 --> 26:19.019
When will the next shipment arrive?

216
26:19.768 --> 26:21.360
Actually, it only just sold out.

217
26:21.854 --> 26:23.450
That customer bought the last of it.

218
26:29.550 --> 26:30.551
Breathe in.

219
26:31.000 --> 26:32.001
Breathe out.

220
26:32.100 --> 26:33.101
Take deep breaths.

221
26:44.603 --> 26:46.560
Hey, what are you doing?

222
26:47.227 --> 26:48.251
Let me return the favor and help you.

223
26:48.384 --> 26:49.385
What are you going to do?

224
26:49.700 --> 26:51.720
Let her massage you. She’s good at locating the pressure lines.

225
26:51.750 --> 26:52.751
She’s a massage therapist.

226
27:06.798 --> 27:07.799
You have flat feet?

227
27:08.797 --> 27:09.798
Yeah.

228
27:17.000 --> 27:18.001
The flatfooted bastard.

229
27:19.050 --> 27:20.200
You’re that flatfooted bastard.

230
27:51.560 --> 27:53.000
You need to loosen up your muscles

231
27:53.043 --> 27:54.360
to improve your circulation.

232
28:40.968 --> 28:41.969
Does that feel better?

233
28:45.000 --> 28:46.801
You need to become more in tune with your body.

234
28:46.850 --> 28:48.351
Then it’ll tell you what’s wrong.

235
28:50.147 --> 28:51.148
Thank you.

236
28:56.718 --> 28:58.250
I never do a favor without expecting something in return.

237
29:08.030 --> 29:09.600
That’s all the medicine. Everything’s here.

238
29:10.031 --> 29:11.320
How much is his?

239
29:12.220 --> 29:13.280
The return you were hoping for.

240
29:15.459 --> 29:16.460
Thank you.

241
29:19.526 --> 29:21.300
Flat feet like yours are very rare.

242
29:21.750 --> 29:23.542
Have you ever met anyone else with feet like yours?

243
29:24.299 --> 29:25.300
No.

244
29:32.395 --> 29:33.500
Consider us even.

245
29:39.592 --> 29:41.100
Phat’s always like that.

246
29:42.659 --> 29:43.660
His name is Phat?

247
29:45.534 --> 29:47.320
He didn't even say goodbye before leaving.

248
29:47.443 --> 29:48.445
Thank you.

249
30:41.491 --> 30:42.880
If cannabis can be legalized,

250
30:42.909 --> 30:44.500
why can’t casinos be legalized too?

251
30:45.176 --> 30:47.760
Go get a law passed for me.

252
30:48.486 --> 30:49.840
There’s a lot of opposition.

253
30:50.144 --> 30:51.660
I think it’ll be difficult this time.

254
30:51.900 --> 30:53.800
The other side doesn’t agree with us either.

255
30:55.240 --> 30:56.441
Name your price.

256
30:58.672 --> 30:59.880
As for the general public,

257
31:00.318 --> 31:02.560
I’ll have someone come up with a catchy slogan

258
31:02.819 --> 31:05.420
and spin it to make the idea sound cool. They’ll soon support it.

259
31:09.411 --> 31:12.320
This country loves freedom, after all.

260
31:12.558 --> 31:14.365
Come on. Let’s celebrate in advance.

261
31:56.742 --> 31:57.960
Are you stealing from me?

262
32:08.822 --> 32:10.440
Hey, no!

263
32:44.650 --> 32:46.800
Mr. Chukiat, leader of the Thai Thamrong Party,

264
32:46.851 --> 32:48.160
one of the opposition coalition parties,

265
32:48.288 --> 32:52.054
has invited Mr. Krit, a former upright police officer

266
32:52.189 --> 32:55.920
who resigned from a promising career in public service

267
32:56.038 --> 32:58.600
because he could no longer tolerate the patronage system,

268
32:58.726 --> 33:01.700
to serve on the ad hoc committee

269
33:01.720 --> 33:04.763
studying ways to promote the creative economy.

270
33:04.960 --> 33:08.200
The committee will focus on scrutinizing the high-profile,

271
33:08.261 --> 33:09.950
Arokaya Land project.

272
33:10.147 --> 33:11.448
Initially,

273
33:11.840 --> 33:15.000
I’ll summon the Cabinet ministers

274
33:15.688 --> 33:19.136
responsible for overseeing this matter

275
33:19.328 --> 33:21.920
to provide explanations before the ad hoc committee.

276
33:22.576 --> 33:23.577
Mr. Krit,

277
33:23.760 --> 33:25.900
is your decision to join this committee

278
33:25.961 --> 33:27.700
and investigate Dongyang’s project

279
33:28.050 --> 33:29.151
connected to the fact that

280
33:29.160 --> 33:32.190
you previously tried to arrest Dongyang and were forced out of the police force?

281
33:33.407 --> 33:34.648
Not at all.

282
33:35.704 --> 33:39.400
I chose to resign from the police force myself

283
33:39.452 --> 33:43.440
because I believed I could do more to serve the public outside the system.

284
33:44.896 --> 33:47.227
Why did you agree to take on this role?

285
33:50.400 --> 33:52.350
Frankly, I’m embarrassed in front of our neighboring countries.

286
33:52.950 --> 33:54.440
It has reached the point where

287
33:54.720 --> 33:57.921
our neighbors have sent their authorities to investigate

288
33:57.961 --> 33:59.600
shady business networks operating in our country.

289
34:00.347 --> 34:04.000
How can those of us with the power and responsibility simply stand by and do nothing?

290
34:06.126 --> 34:10.160
And to anyone who thinks I’m doing this for revenge,

291
34:10.850 --> 34:11.960
dismiss that thought right now.

292
34:13.011 --> 34:15.520
For this mission, I’m willing to make myself a target

293
34:15.627 --> 34:17.060
and face all the public backlash

294
34:18.064 --> 34:19.600
for the good of our country.

295
34:20.437 --> 34:22.200
We'll see about that, sir.

296
34:32.310 --> 34:33.920
Where the hell did you learn massage?

297
34:35.451 --> 34:36.452
Well...

298
34:36.790 --> 34:37.960
You’re useless.

299
34:40.045 --> 34:41.347
Get out.

300
34:41.694 --> 34:44.000
- Get the fuck out! - Mr. Dongyang.

301
34:46.019 --> 34:49.272
These are the therapists your Master Tim handpicked?

302
34:49.605 --> 34:50.944
Not one of them is any good.

303
34:51.029 --> 34:52.427
Bring me someone else.

304
34:52.720 --> 34:55.320
Calm down, Dongyang.

305
34:56.923 --> 34:58.400
Please calm down.

306
35:02.699 --> 35:04.190
Some conditions

307
35:05.678 --> 35:10.120
can also depend on your own physical capabilities.

308
35:12.043 --> 35:13.728
I thought you said Thai massage was effective.

309
35:15.000 --> 35:16.001
Pathetic.

310
35:18.432 --> 35:19.933
You can insult the therapist,

311
35:22.022 --> 35:23.664
but don’t insult the art of Thai massage.

312
35:29.475 --> 35:30.476
Muk.

313
35:30.998 --> 35:32.680
Find a new therapist for Dongyang.

314
35:34.502 --> 35:35.503
Yes.

315
35:38.678 --> 35:39.679
Uh...

316
35:39.824 --> 35:42.240
I know a younger therapist at the massage shop where I used to work.

317
35:42.400 --> 35:43.650
She’s an excellent masseuse.

318
35:43.699 --> 35:44.700
No.

319
35:45.192 --> 35:47.360
- We don’t hire freelance therapists here. - Make an appointment with her.

320
35:47.800 --> 35:50.401
If she’s good, I’ll give you a tip too.

321
35:51.320 --> 35:52.321
Yes, sir.

322
35:56.843 --> 35:58.427
Will I give a massage to the Chinese owner of Arokaya?

323
35:59.286 --> 36:00.287
You mean Dongyang?

324
36:00.486 --> 36:03.400
Yes. He asked me to give him a Kasai massage.

325
36:03.590 --> 36:04.920
His little bird wouldn’t sing.

326
36:07.900 --> 36:09.900
Dongyang has erectile dysfunction?

327
36:10.700 --> 36:11.701
Exactly.

328
36:11.801 --> 36:15.480
I gave it everything I had, hoping for a huge tip.

329
36:16.259 --> 36:18.700
But what could I do? He couldn’t get it up.

330
36:19.683 --> 36:22.045
He berated me and caused a huge scene.

331
36:22.966 --> 36:25.056
That’s why I thought of you.

332
36:35.624 --> 36:37.560
Areeya recommended this therapist.

333
36:38.424 --> 36:40.000
The one you once lectured.

334
36:42.054 --> 36:43.055
Bring her in.

335
36:45.718 --> 36:48.400
There are plenty of other therapists. Why does it have to be her?

336
36:49.046 --> 36:52.047
She has good hands—better than yours.

337
36:56.174 --> 36:57.175
Go.

338
37:15.398 --> 37:18.250
Dad, I need your advice about kasai massage.

339
37:37.750 --> 37:39.150
[TREATING WIND DISORDERS IN MEN]

340
38:21.528 --> 38:23.360
Whoa, you’re really dedicated.

341
38:24.334 --> 38:26.072
Why have you been training so hard these past few days?

342
38:29.043 --> 38:30.766
Areeya found me a new client.

343
38:32.240 --> 38:33.241
For a Kasai massage.

344
38:38.700 --> 38:39.701
A Kasai massage?

345
38:40.280 --> 38:41.781
Who is it? Is it dangerous?

346
38:42.886 --> 38:45.000
You’ve never done one before. Do you know how?

347
38:51.355 --> 38:52.356
Of course.

348
38:54.240 --> 38:55.880
As long as I press the correct sen lines.

349
39:00.307 --> 39:03.440
A young woman’s severed arm has been found washed ashore.

350
39:03.496 --> 39:05.520
It has one highly distinctive feature:

351
39:05.597 --> 39:07.998
a rose tattoo,

352
39:08.107 --> 39:10.860
which may link it to the case of a young entertainer

353
39:10.960 --> 39:12.938
whose friends recently reported her missing.

354
39:13.030 --> 39:15.440
She disappeared after accepting a job

355
39:15.531 --> 39:18.600
entertaining a wealthy businessman behind a famous wellness company,

356
39:18.728 --> 39:22.880
known in the industry as Mr. D

357
39:23.816 --> 39:24.840
Mr. D?

358
39:26.707 --> 39:27.708
Dongyang?

359
39:36.708 --> 39:38.880
Wan, Wan, Wan!

360
39:39.800 --> 39:42.600
I can go by myself. I don’t need your help.

361
39:42.971 --> 39:44.560
You never listen to my warnings.

362
39:45.000 --> 39:46.640
Dongyang and his men are no ordinary people.

363
39:46.947 --> 39:48.307
I’m only going to scout the place and find an escape route.

364
39:48.509 --> 39:49.560
How are you going to get inside?

365
39:50.990 --> 39:52.600
I’ll go in as a customer.

366
39:53.011 --> 39:54.250
They won’t do anything to a customer.

367
40:03.440 --> 40:06.240
Hello. Welcome to Arokaya Land.

368
40:06.600 --> 40:09.200
Which massage program are you interested in?

369
40:09.501 --> 40:11.040
We offer relaxation massage,

370
40:11.140 --> 40:12.910
therapeutic massage, and treatments for specific conditions.

371
40:13.123 --> 40:15.680
- I’ll have a Thai massage. - Certainly. Please wait a moment.

372
40:29.118 --> 40:30.500
I’ll use the restroom first.

373
40:30.510 --> 40:32.160
The restroom is right over there.

374
40:32.520 --> 40:33.521
- Thank you. - You’re welcome.

375
41:20.419 --> 41:21.420
Excuse me, sir.

376
41:24.675 --> 41:25.676
Yes?

377
41:26.323 --> 41:28.160
Uh, I’m looking for the restroom.

378
41:30.050 --> 41:31.451
It’s that way.

379
41:31.584 --> 41:32.585
Oh.

380
41:33.400 --> 41:34.401
Right.

381
41:43.586 --> 41:46.720
I couldn’t find it earlier. Thanks again.

382
41:55.928 --> 41:57.800
Is the therapist named Areeya not here?

383
41:58.494 --> 42:00.160
Is she your regular therapist?

384
42:01.368 --> 42:02.569
I’ll go and get her for you.

385
42:02.579 --> 42:03.580
Oh, no.

386
42:04.240 --> 42:05.500
We just know each other.

387
42:20.067 --> 42:21.320
If you weren’t so stressed,

388
42:21.920 --> 42:23.120
you’d smell much nicer.

389
42:25.528 --> 42:26.529
Excuse me?

390
42:27.560 --> 42:28.561
I’m sorry.

391
42:28.720 --> 42:29.840
Are you feeling unwell?

392
42:30.315 --> 42:31.316
No.

393
42:32.363 --> 42:35.120
If a therapist is sick, we aren’t allowed to work.

394
42:35.632 --> 42:36.633
That’s not what I meant.

395
42:36.774 --> 42:39.320
I meant, is something bothering you?

396
42:41.628 --> 42:42.800
Your scent gives it away.

397
42:43.611 --> 42:44.612
Excuse me?

398
42:46.800 --> 42:47.801
Never mind.

399
42:52.414 --> 42:54.720
Do you get many clients requesting kasai massage here?

400
42:55.936 --> 42:57.037
We get some.

401
43:00.054 --> 43:01.960
Are you interested in having one?

402
43:02.600 --> 43:03.601
No.

403
43:05.120 --> 43:06.121
By the way,

404
43:07.590 --> 43:10.100
does anyone here have flat feet?

405
43:11.254 --> 43:12.255
Excuse me?

406
43:12.816 --> 43:14.840
I’ve heard about it before, but I’ve never seen anyone with them.

407
43:15.224 --> 43:16.525
Neither have I.

408
43:19.600 --> 43:21.901
Please lie down on the massage bed.

409
43:36.750 --> 43:38.170
Have you ever had a massage before?

410
43:39.100 --> 43:40.240
Not often.

411
43:53.758 --> 43:54.920
Please lie on your side.

412
44:04.392 --> 44:06.480
I’d rather have you massage somewhere else.

413
44:06.784 --> 44:08.080
Then lie on your back, please.

414
44:33.931 --> 44:34.932
I’m sorry.

415
44:35.083 --> 44:37.680
It’s okay. Accidentally farting is perfectly natural.

416
44:37.872 --> 44:39.220
What? Accidentally farting?

417
44:39.500 --> 44:40.501
Yes.

418
44:41.883 --> 44:43.680
Let’s try again. Hold my hands.

419
44:47.824 --> 44:48.825
Wait.

420
44:49.355 --> 44:50.356
Wait a moment.

421
44:52.427 --> 44:54.720
I think that’s enough.

422
44:54.800 --> 44:55.801
Thank you.

423
45:16.000 --> 45:17.800
- Go to Arokaya. - Yes, Boss.

424
47:05.851 --> 47:06.852
You’re here?

425
47:10.339 --> 47:11.340
Come here.

426
47:12.184 --> 47:14.360
If you’re as good as they say, you’ll be rewarded.

427
47:15.811 --> 47:17.560
But if you waste my time,

428
47:18.812 --> 47:20.413
you’re going to get hurt.

429
47:24.958 --> 47:26.500
Let me warm up your muscles first.

430
49:28.600 --> 49:29.601
I’m ready.

431
50:28.752 --> 50:31.600
Dad, I need your advice about kasai massage.

432
50:32.595 --> 50:33.700
Open the wind gates.

433
50:34.515 --> 50:37.360
The blood will begin to flow, spreading warmth

434
50:38.264 --> 50:39.600
and helping the muscles relax.

435
50:53.880 --> 50:54.960
Please lie on your side.

436
51:02.448 --> 51:03.920
Work on the Rattakhat, Pattakhat, and Santakhat lines too.

437
51:23.635 --> 51:24.760
You have to press deeply

438
51:25.699 --> 51:26.800
and in the right direction.

439
51:27.800 --> 51:28.801
This point

440
51:29.779 --> 51:31.500
sends heat through the shaft.

441
51:42.267 --> 51:43.520
There’s another technique,

442
51:44.376 --> 51:45.840
but will you have the courage to try it?

443
51:59.046 --> 52:01.750
Amazing.

444
52:41.760 --> 52:43.960
You remind me of another therapist.

445
52:47.091 --> 52:48.092
Who was it?

446
52:48.435 --> 52:49.640
That therapist is fucking dead.

447
52:55.894 --> 52:57.100
I stimulated one of your sen lines.

448
52:57.755 --> 52:59.160
All the lines are interconnected.

449
53:08.918 --> 53:09.919
What a shame.

450
53:10.374 --> 53:12.280
All the good therapists are fucking dead.

451
53:14.137 --> 53:15.480
Did you hit another sen line again?

452
53:17.920 --> 53:19.500
If you can cure me,

453
53:20.683 --> 53:22.840
name your price.

454
53:29.467 --> 53:31.800
Ittha, Pingkhala,

455
53:32.091 --> 53:34.680
Sumana, Kalathari,

456
53:35.360 --> 53:37.640
Sahatsarangsi,

457
53:38.060 --> 53:40.641
Thawari, Chanthaphusang,

458
53:41.061 --> 53:43.320
Rucham, Sukhumang, and

459
53:43.619 --> 53:45.050
Sikhini.

460
54:14.774 --> 54:15.605
Hey!

461
54:15.755 --> 54:17.056
What? What the fuck is this?

462
54:30.160 --> 54:31.761
You bitch!

463
54:31.961 --> 54:32.962
Are you one of them?

464
54:39.891 --> 54:40.892
Shit!

465
55:19.310 --> 55:21.101
This place is more dangerous than you think.

466
55:24.480 --> 55:25.481
Stay still.

467
55:26.918 --> 55:27.919
Hey!

468
55:28.840 --> 55:30.360
Isn’t there any other way?

469
55:30.645 --> 55:32.960
I’ll kill him before he even realizes what’s happening.

470
55:34.406 --> 55:36.960
She uses the pressure point at the base of the skull as an anchor

471
55:37.125 --> 55:39.360
to transmit force to the blood vessels in the neck.

472
55:39.434 --> 55:41.080
That’s a dangerous pressure point.

473
55:42.758 --> 55:43.759
Hey!

474
55:47.920 --> 55:49.360
Who sent you?
